# REQUIRES: python-api, torch, cuda
# Tracked writable DLPack borrows of a simulation on a GPU
# (D[python-dlpack-write]), Inputs/python_dlpack_write.py with PyTorch as
# the consumer that writes, on a stream of its own, with writes still under
# way when the borrow is committed. The feature `torch` is set when the
# interpreter of the tests imports torch, or when lit is given
# -Dtorch_python=<an interpreter with torch>.
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_dlpack_write.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU torch | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Double: commits of positions, velocities, the cell, and tunables equal the existing interface to the bit, and 12 steps later
# CHECK: Double: a live borrow blocks run, evaluation, update, view, borrow, state, and checkpoint; a commit waits for the consumer's tensors
# CHECK: Double: an abandoned borrow leaves the run that of a simulation without it, to the bit
# CHECK: Double: refused commits (positions not finite, a structural change of a tunable, values an update refuses, a cell below twice the cutoff) change nothing
# CHECK: Double: a tensor outlives its borrow and its simulation; commits and abandoned borrows in turn
# CHECK: Mixed: commits of positions, velocities, the cell, and tunables equal the existing interface to the bit, and 12 steps later
# CHECK: Mixed: a live borrow blocks run, evaluation, update, view, borrow, state, and checkpoint; a commit waits for the consumer's tensors
# CHECK: Mixed: an abandoned borrow leaves the run that of a simulation without it, to the bit
# CHECK: Mixed: refused commits (positions not finite, a structural change of a tunable, values an update refuses, a cell below twice the cutoff) change nothing
# CHECK: Mixed: a tensor outlives its borrow and its simulation; commits and abandoned borrows in turn
# CHECK: leapfrog without tunables, and the default mode: commits take what was written
# CHECK: a commit whose evaluation fails is undone: the state and values of before the borrow
# CHECK: consumer writes outstanding at the commit are waited for
# CHECK: dlpack write torch passed
